<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, calm down. I'm gonna go tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> right now, tell her to take us back to Motoki-cho."</STYLE>
