<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... why would </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... something this creepy..."</STYLE>
