<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, it's all right. At least, the reason it's written in blood is that he needed to write a note without anyone getting suspicious. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">If he wanted to write anything during the thirteenth-year memorial service just now, this was simply the only way to do it." [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Without anyone getting suspicious? Why...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Probably </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> noticed. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">That the residents' suspicions are aimed at </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No...! So it's because I have a witch's power after all!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　But I haven't told anyone else about my intuition!?"</STYLE><PG>
