{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Pack your stuff, now! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> says she's getting the car out!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
